*                                                                *   1 1451
* This evaluation is based on the CAB Model for light water[1]   *   1 1451
* in a liquid state, T < T-crit(H2O) = 647.1 K. Two extrapolated *   1 1451
* temperature points at 650 K and 800 K were added for backwards *   1 1451
* compatibility with ENDF/B-VII.1 scripts. The file (MF7) was    *   1 1451
* generated using NJOY 99.396[1] with a patch (upcab).           *   1 1451
*                                                                *   1 1451
* The CAB model is a further improvement of ENDF/B-VII (2006)    *   1 1451
* and IKE, Stuttgart (2005) models for light water (incoherent   *   1 1451
* inelastic approximation for n + H-in-H2O & vibrational         *   1 1451
* spectrum decomposition). The continuous spectrum[2] is based   *   1 1451
* on MD GROMACS Calculations[2] and diffusion coefficients       *   1 1451
* measured by Yoshida[3] and Mills[4].                           *   1 1451
*                                                                *   1 1451
